export anchor DarkroomStyle:
    number: 249
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Darkroom
    idea: The editor is a photographic darkroom under a deep red safelight, with the canvas as a print in a developing tray, the inspector as exposure notes and the layers as a numbered film strip.
    base: dark
    palette:
        room: #140a09, the page behind the safelight glow
        bench: #1e100e, the top bar, the notes card, the status bar and the sheet cards
        tray: #0d0606, the canvas tray
        film: #0a0505, the film strip base
        line: #4a2a25, edges and rules
        sprocket: #3b2420, film strip holes
        safelight: #be1e14, a radial glow at 42 percent centred on the tray
        ink: #f4ddd6, warm text
        muted: #c99f95, labels and type words
        safeRed: #ff5a4c, selection, the notes heading, the active knob and the lamp
        safeButton: #c4231a, the Share button under white text
        amber: #ffb45e, timer readouts, frame numbers, Saved, the comment pin and focus
        paper: #fbf7f2, the print border around the frame
    type:
        Avenir Next, Segoe UI, system-ui, Roboto, Arial for text, Georgia
        for the frame headline and the sheet title, and ui-monospace for
        readouts and labels. Body 14px at 1.45. Readouts 15 to 16px mono
        600 in amber, labels 11 to 13px mono caps tracked 0.12 to 0.14em,
        and the sheet title 30px Georgia 600.
    layout:
        A bench coloured top bar holds a glowing red lamp, Website redesign
        and Home v3, six round enlarger knobs for the tools with Move ringed
        red, an amber ZOOM 66% timer readout, three ringed initials, Present
        and a red Share. Below, the canvas fills the left as a dark tray
        with 18px corners and a red inner glow, the Hero frame inside as a
        print with a paper border, a red selection line and red crop marks
        at the corners, and the comment as an amber pinned note tilted one
        degree. A 300px Exposure notes card on ruled paper sits right, with
        amber mono readouts for X, Y, W and H, then ruled lines for Fill,
        Auto layout, Gap, Padding, Corner radius and Export, and an Export
        print button. Under both runs a full width film strip with sprocket
        holes top and bottom, each layer a 168px frame numbered 1A to 7A,
        children marked in Hero, Hero outlined red and glowing with
        SELECTED, Features marked COLLAPSED. A mono status bar closes it.
        Below 760px the notes and strip hide and the six knobs sit in a
        short film strip under the canvas.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28 to 32px around the tray, 16px card padding, 6px between film frames.
    density: Medium. Tray and notes side by side, the film strip across the full width below.
    corners: Mixed. 18px tray, 4 to 6px cards and buttons, round knobs and avatars, square film frames.
    borders: 1px #4a2a25 everywhere, red on the selected film frame, the selection and the active knob.
    shadows: A red inner glow in the tray, a red outer glow on the selected film frame and a dark drop under the print.
    icons:
        18px line icons at 1.7px stroke inside round 40px knobs. Saved uses
        a check circle in amber, editing two people and the version a tag,
        each with its words in mono.
    focus: A 2px amber outline offset 3px.
    tone: Gentle darkroom words, such as Exposure notes and Export print, plain elsewhere.
